% ==========================================================================
% Master bibliography — 2026 Comp Exam
%
% `keywords` field marks reading-list status: {official} = on the assigned
% comps list (has its own top-level folder); {extra} = supplementary /
% "Extra Readings" pool. This field is read by tools/citation_dashboard.py
% and is otherwise ignored by standard bibliography styles.
%
% Cite in LaTeX as \cite{key}, e.g. \cite{putnam1993}.
%
% This file is HAND-MAINTAINED and is never rewritten by any script. Add
% anything here that is not in Zotero. Entries here also take precedence
% over the generated zotero.bib, so a key defined here always wins.
%
% Copy-and-paste templates for new entries live in bib-templates.txt, in
% this same folder. They are kept in a separate file on purpose: BibTeX does
% NOT honour % as a comment character. It scans for the at-sign, so a
% "commented-out" entry sitting in here is still parsed as a real one and
% breaks the whole bibliography. Never put an at-sign in these notes.
% ==========================================================================

